This project is middlemarker/FSE-Planner-wx-atc on branch weather-atc-layers-work. Read AGENTS.md before changing weather, VATSIM, or route-search behavior.

The environment API in server/ is required for VATSIM, METAR, airspace, and weather tiles. Do not point the browser at NOAA, VATSIM status, or bookings directly.

Weather map rules already implemented:

- Several weather types can be visible at once. Precipitation is above clouds.
- Missing coverage is hatched. Do not hatch clear sky or zero precipitation inside a covered tile.
- Clouds use the latest complete daily GIBS composite. Clear sky stays faintly visible. Clouds are dark grey.
- RainViewer native zoom stops at 7. Higher map zooms stretch that tile. Never display the provider's unsupported-zoom image.
- The layers panel stays limited to controls. Put warnings and errors behind the status icon.

GFS cloud ceiling is not implemented. Do not describe it as available.
